## II. Hypergeometric Distribution

### 1. Sample of 10 selected from a box of 40 ($N = 40$)

```{r}
# Parameters for Box of 40
N1 <- 40
m1 <- 4        # 10% defective
n1 <- N1 - m1  # 36 non-defective
k_sample <- 10

# Probability of > 10% defectives
p1 <- phyper(1, m = m1, n = n1, k = k_sample, lower.tail = FALSE)
cat("P(Defectives > 10% | N = 40) =", round(p1, 4), "\n")
```

